<title>USA: Wave Technologies Intl Q4 April 30 net up.</title>
<headline>Wave Technologies Intl Q4 April 30 net up.</headline>
<dateline>ST. LOUIS 1997-06-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Fourth Quarter		Year</p>
<p>			     1997	 1996	 1997	 1996</p>
<p> Revenues		  8,775	6,464     30,826     24,369</p>
<p>Income (loss) before taxes</p>
<p>				 336	  180	1,278	(724)</p>
<p> Income tax benefit	250	    0	  250	    0</p>
<p> Net Income (loss)	 586	  180	1,528	(724)</p>
<p>Net earnings (loss) per share</p>
<p>				0.15	 0.05	 0.39     (0.19)</p>
<p>Weighted average</p>
<p>common shares outstanding</p>
<p>			 3,992,399  3,946,338  3,968,739  3,791,562</p>
<p>All amounts, except share data, are in thousands.</p>
<p>NOTE: Fiscal 1997 year net includes a reserve for the settlement of a lawsuit and certain tax benefits associated with a change in the company's deferred tax valuation allowance, which together added $0.02 to earnings per share.</p>
<p>Wave Technologies International Inc is full company name.</p>
<p>		 ((Chicago newsdesk 312 408 8787))</p>
